Subject: [PATCH 4/5] HALL-1 r2 (OFF): clear the z=12 posts, warm the altar,
 candle stands at the altar

Round 1 (candidate 6.33 vs main 5.70 at High, every set > +0.5): judges still
call the near-field posts PRESENT and the shrine views face a cool-blue altar
with the hearth behind the camera. r2 removes the z=12 nave posts, braces, tie
and their lantern; lights the altar's own emissive mask warm gold; adds two lit
candle stands either side of it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
